कि.मी. की डिस्टेंस पर है। नाउ लेट्स मूव अहेड एंड टेक अ क्लोजर लुक एट द प्रोजेक्ट। [संगीत] Mahindra मरीना 64 मलाड वेस्ट में लगभग 3 एकड़ में फैला एक वी डेवलपमेंट प्रोजेक्ट है। इसे मल्टीपल फेसेस में डेवलप किया जा रहा है। जिसमें करेंटली टावर एफ और टावर जी ल्च हो चुके हैं। दोनों टास्क का पजेशन एस पर रेरा [संगीत] 31 दिसंबर 2029","score":0.79958355,"raw_content":null,"id":"ad5b9f-05"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/mahindra-marina-64-malad-east-mumbai-p76327","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 in Malad East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price","content":"Key sports amenities include a Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Car Parking, Power Back-up, Water Storage,","score":0.78709817,"raw_content":null,"id":"05febc-06"},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/mahindra-marina-64/339293/project","title":"Mahindra Marina 64 Malad West, Mumbai | Price List & Floor Plan","content":"Mahindra Marina 64 is located at Malad West Mumbai, Malad West, Mumbai Western Suburbs, Mumbai - 400064. It is well connected via New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Western Express Highway and is close to landmarks like Orchids The International School, Malad West, Infiniti Mall, Ghodbunder Road.\n\n### Who is the developer of Mahindra Marina 64 and what is their track record?\n\nMahindra Marina 64 is developed by Mahindra Lifespaces, with 25 years of experience and 95.successfully delivered projects\n\n### What are the key amenities of Mahindra Marina 64, Mumbai? [...] |  |  |\n --- |\n| Details | Information |\n| Project Name | Mahindra Marina 64 |\n| Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Mahindra Lifespaces |\n| Project Type | Premium Residential Development |\n| Configuration | 2 and 3 BHK Apartments |\n| Land Parcel | Approx. 4.5 Acres |\n| Towers | Multiple towers with high-rise structure |\n| Possession | December 2029 |\n| Project Status | Under Development |\n\nDetails\n\nInformation\n\nProject Name\n\nMahindra